title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 3
frequency: 500
is-card: true
card-image: img/Fundraising.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ dues + 10 +] resources gained.
on-arrival: resources = resources + dues + 10;

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ dues - 9 +] resources gained.
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources = resources + dues + 10; communist_dissent -= 20; maximalist_dissent -= 20; reformist_dissent -= 20; labour_dissent -= 20; syndicalist_dissent -= 20 if syndicalist_active

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: [+ dues + 11 +] resources gained. [? if unemployment >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources = resources + dues + 10
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployment >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

